<title>INDONESIA: Bank Negara Q1 net up to 115.5 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Bank Negara Q1 net up to 115.5 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31</p>
<p>			     (in billion rupiah unless specified)</p>
<p>    Net income		   115.5	vs    103.7</p>
<p>    Earning per share (rph)     27	vs	 38</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	     160.0	vs    145.2</p>
<p>    Operating profit	   164.0	vs    142.7</p>
<p>    Income before minority   116.5	vs    104.4</p>
<p>interest</p>
<p>NOTE : The results were unaudited. PT Bank Negara Indonesia is a state-controlled bank.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
